# Traveling Chocobo's ruling: with a land that has an Adventure on top of the library, "you can play [the land], but you
# can't cast [its Adventure]" - the Adventure is judged by its own characteristics (CR 715.3a), and Mage Siege is no Bird
# spell. With {2}{R} untapped Bot1 may not cast Mage Siege off the top, and plays Lindblum, Industrial Regency from there as
# its land play; it enters tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Traveling Chocobo
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Island
Lindblum, Industrial Regency
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Traveling Chocobo.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
! Bot1.Library.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Cast
Bot1.Library.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Play

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Lindblum, Industrial Regency.Tapped = true
Bot1.Library.Count = 15
Bot1.Battlefield = Lindblum, Industrial Regency; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire; Traveling Chocobo
